Once you have telepathy it is a *very* good idea to keep a few
tins of floating eye meat in case of typo.  Once you hit max
strength it is a *very* good idea to keep a few tins of assorted
giant meat in case you lose your poison resistance intrinsic.

Until you get enough tins of tengu to be confient of getting
teleport control, it is a good idea to gather enough tins of
nymph to be confident of getting teleportitis.  Then once you
have that hoard get hungry and start a fest of both to get both
intrinsics in sequence.

Once you have a tinning kit the strategy for acquiring intrinsics
is far safer and more systematic.



